  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Empowerment of Pastoral and Agro-pastoral Women in the Horn of Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower women in pastoralist communities by equipping them with business and production skills to enable them to undertake new economic activities, or expand existing ones. Promote their access to rural finance providers and their access to markets.</narrative>
